  The draft says the shop has sold at Rs.10 for 10 years and calls the price 'unchanged' (விலை மாறவில்லை); the article only says it has been Rs.10 for over 10 years, which is roughly consistent, but the reel_script claims the same 10-year period as 'ரூ.10க்கு 5 பானிபூரி விற்று வருகிறது' without the article's note that it has been 10 years, so this is minor and not an error.
